 "directives": [
  {
   "text": "Before starting to execute a task, make sure you have a clear understanding of the task and the codebase.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.85,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Preliminary tasks",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:12",
   "id": "d001"
  },
  {
   "text": "Call information-gathering tools to gather the necessary information.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.85,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Preliminary tasks",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:12",
   "id": "d002"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you need information about the current state of the codebase, use the codebase-retrieval tool.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.85,
   "tools": [
    "codebase-retrieval"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "semantic_search"
   ],
   "section": "Preliminary tasks",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:12",
   "id": "d003"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you need information about previous changes to the codebase, use the git-commit-retrieval tool.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.85,
   "tools": [
    "git-commit-retrieval"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "other"
   ],
   "section": "Preliminary tasks",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:12",
   "id": "d004"
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember that the codebase may have changed since the commit was made, so you may need to check the current codebase to see if the information is still accurate.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.85,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Preliminary tasks",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:12",
   "id": "d005"
  },
  {
   "text": "Be sure to be careful and exhaustive.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.64,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:29",
   "id": "d006"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you need more information during planning, feel free to perform more information-gathering steps",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.61,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:31",
   "id": "d007"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ensure each sub task represents a meaningful unit of work that would take a professional developer approximately 20 minutes to complete. Avoid overly granular tasks that represent single actions",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.59,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:33",
   "id": "d008"
  },
  {
   "text": "Use `add_tasks` to create individual new tasks or subtasks",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.56,
   "tools": [
    "add_tasks"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "todo"
   ],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:35",
   "id": "d009"
  },
  {
   "text": "Always use batch updates when updating multiple tasks (e.g., marking current task complete and next task in progress)",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.51,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:39",
   "id": "d010"
  },
  {
   "text": "Use `reorganize_tasklist` only for complex restructuring that affects many tasks at once",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.5,
   "tools": [
    "reorganize_tasklist"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "other"
   ],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:40",
   "id": "d011"
  },
  {
   "text": "When starting work on a new task, use a single `update_tasks` call to mark the previous task complete and the new task in progress",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.48,
   "tools": [
    "update_tasks"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "todo"
   ],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:42",
   "id": "d012"
  },
  {
   "text": "Use batch updates: `{\"tasks\": [{\"task_id\": \"previous-task\", \"state\": \"COMPLETE\"}, {\"task_id\": \"current-task\", \"state\": \"IN_PROGRESS\"}]}`",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.46,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Planning and Task Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:43",
   "id": "d013"
  },
  {
   "text": "When making edits, use the str_replace_editor - do NOT just write a new file.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d014"
  },
  {
   "text": "Before calling the str_replace_editor tool, ALWAYS first call the codebase-retrieval tool asking for highly detailed information about the code you want to edit.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 3,
   "score": 34.35,
   "tools": [
    "codebase-retrieval"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "semantic_search"
   ],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d015"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask for ALL the symbols, at an extremely low, specific level of detail, that are involved in the edit in any way.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d016"
  },
  {
   "text": "Do this all in a single call - don't call the tool a bunch of times unless you get new information that requires you to ask for more details.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d017"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the edit involves an instance of a class, ask for information about the class.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d018"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the edit involves a property of a class, ask for information about the class and the property.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d019"
  },
  {
   "text": "If several of the above apply, ask for all of them in a single call.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d020"
  },
  {
   "text": "When in any doubt, include the symbol or object.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d021"
  },
  {
   "text": "When making changes, be very conservative and respect the codebase.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Making edits",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:52",
   "id": "d022"
  },
  {
   "text": "Always use appropriate package managers for dependency management instead of manually editing package configuration files.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.19,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Package Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:65",
   "id": "d023"
  },
  {
   "text": "Always use package managers for installing, updating, or removing dependencies rather than directly editing files like package.json, requirements.txt, Cargo.toml, go.mod, etc.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.16,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Package Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:67",
   "id": "d024"
  },
  {
   "text": "PHP: Use `composer require`, `composer remove`",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.06,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Package Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:75",
   "id": "d025"
  },
  {
   "text": "Exception: Only edit package files directly when performing complex configuration changes that cannot be accomplished through package manager commands (e.g., custom scripts, build configurations, or repository settings).",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.99,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Package Management",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:81",
   "id": "d026"
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't start your response by saying a question or idea or observation was good, great, fascinating, profound, excellent, or any other positive adjective. Skip the flattery and respond directly.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 22.82,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Following instructions",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:94",
   "id": "d027"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you write code, suggest to the user to test the code by writing tests and running them.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.79,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Testing",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:97",
   "id": "d028"
  },
  {
   "text": "Before running tests, make sure that you know how tests relating to the user's request should be run.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.79,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Testing",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:97",
   "id": "d029"
  },
  {
   "text": "When showing the user code from existing file, don't wrap it in normal markdown `) instead of three.",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.7,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Displaying code",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:104",
   "id": "d030"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you fail to wrap code in this way, it will not be visible to the user. BE VERY BRIEF BY ONLY PROVIDING <10 LINES OF THE CODE. If you give correct XML structure, it will be parsed into a clickable code block, and the user can always click it to see the part in the full file.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 3,
   "score": 33.51,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Displaying code",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:119",
   "id": "d031"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you notice yourself going around in circles, or going down a rabbit hole, for example calling the same tool in similar ways multiple times to accomplish the same task, ask the user for help.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.46,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Recovering from difficulties",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:123",
   "id": "d032"
  },
  {
   "text": "Consider reviewing the Current Task List using `view_tasklist` to check status.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.4,
   "tools": [
    "view_tasklist"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "other"
   ],
   "section": "Final",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:128",
   "id": "d033"
  },
  {
   "text": "If further changes, new tasks, or follow-up actions are identified, you may use `update_tasks` to reflect these in the task list.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.39,
   "tools": [
    "update_tasks"
   ],
   "capabilities": [
    "todo"
   ],
   "section": "Final",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:129",
   "id": "d034"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the task list was updated, briefly outline the next immediate steps to the user based on the revised list. If you have made code edits, always suggest writing or updating tests and executing those tests to make sure the changes are correct.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.38,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Final",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:130",
   "id": "d035"
  },
  {
   "text": "Search for information to carry out the user request",
   "category": "tool_policy",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 11.12,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Summary of most important instructions",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:150",
   "id": "d036"
  },
  {
   "text": "Consider using task management tools for complex work that benefits from structured planning",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.11,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Summary of most important instructions",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:151",
   "id": "d037"
  },
  {
   "text": "Make sure you have all the information before making edits",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.1,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Summary of most important instructions",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:152",
   "id": "d038"
  },
  {
   "text": "Always use package managers for dependency management instead of manually editing package files",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.09,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Summary of most important instructions",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:153",
   "id": "d039"
  },
  {
   "text": "Focus on following user instructions and ask before carrying out any actions beyond the user's instructions",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.07,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Summary of most important instructions",
   "src": "ref-repo/Augment Code/claude-4-sonnet-agent-prompts.txt:154",
   "id": "d040"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you find yourself repeatedly calling tools without making progress, ask the user for help",
   "category": "tool_policy",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 11.05,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "Summary of most important instructions",
